# TIN TROOP 2-A, start to finish with plain button presses (recorded once
# from a route plan). A stone under the tap stops the water: the tub drains
# through its plughole and its fish die with it. The next soldier crosses
# the dry tub, dives through the basin for the +5, climbs out and lances
# the mouse; a stone at the foot of the last box is the step over it.
game tintroop
wait 5
cheat unlock
press A
wait 5
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press A
wait 30
press A
